Source: @PNAME@-ohpc
Section: science
Priority: optional
Maintainer: VersatusHPC <packages@versatushpc.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13),
               ohpc-buildroot,
               lmod-ohpc,
               @COMPILER_DEP@,
               @MPI_DEP@,
               @BUILD_DEPENDS@
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: @HOMEPAGE@

Package: @PNAME@-@COMPILER_FAMILY@-@MPI_FAMILY@-ohpc
Architecture: any
Depends: ohpc-filesystem, @COMPILER_DEP@, @MPI_DEP@,
         ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: @DESCRIPTION_SHORT@ (@COMPILER_FAMILY@/@MPI_FAMILY@, OpenHPC)
 @DESCRIPTION_LONG@
 .
 Built with the @COMPILER_FAMILY@ compiler and @MPI_FAMILY@ MPI family.
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.

Package: @PNAME@-@COMPILER_FAMILY@-@MPI_FAMILY@-devel-ohpc
Architecture: any
Depends: @PNAME@-@COMPILER_FAMILY@-@MPI_FAMILY@-ohpc (= ${binary:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: @DESCRIPTION_SHORT@ development files (@COMPILER_FAMILY@/@MPI_FAMILY@, OpenHPC)
 Development headers and libraries for @PNAME@.
 .
 Built with the @COMPILER_FAMILY@ compiler and @MPI_FAMILY@ MPI family.
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
